<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Appraisal Submitted</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;">
    <h2>Appraisal Submitted</h2>
    <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
    <p>
        <strong>{{employeeName}}</strong> has submitted their appraisal for your review.
    </p>
    <p>Please log in to the employee management system to review and provide your feedback.</p>

    <p>
        <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}/appraisal/team-appraisals"
            style="padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px;">
            Review Appraisal
        </a>
    </p>

    <p>Best regards,<br />EMS</p>
</body>

</html>